{"id":"c54ff90bd11c2ea4","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-measure9-transition-semigroup.md","title":"ZFC Measure9 Transition Semigroup","display":"df-zfc-measure9-transition-semigroup — ZFC Measure9 Transition Semigroup","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure9-transition-semigroup","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure9-transition-semigroup"],"display":"df-zfc-measure9-transition-semigroup — ZFC Measure9 Transition Semigroup","depends_on":["[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-prob2-transition-semigroup.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure9-transition-semigroup"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure9-transition-semigroup</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure9-transition-semigroup — ZFC Measure9 Transition Semigroup"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e8b953a1717b11c0\" href=\"?note=e8b953a1717b11c0\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-prob2-transition-semigroup.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-prob2-transition-semigroup.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\Sigma)\">\\((X,\\Sigma)\\)</span> (measurable state space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> (additive time-index set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_\\bullet\">\\(P_\\bullet\\)</span> (time-indexed Markov kernels)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2TransitionSemigroup}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb2TransitionSemigroup}_S\\)</span> (canonical predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e8b953a1717b11c0\" href=\"?note=e8b953a1717b11c0\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-prob2-transition-semigroup.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-prob2-transition-semigroup.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureTransitionSemigroup}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureTransitionSemigroup}_S\\)</span> (compatibility predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure9\\text{-}transition\\text{-}semigroup} \\vdash \\mathrm{MeasureTransitionSemigroup}_S(P_\\bullet,I,X,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcProb2TransitionSemigroup}_S(P_\\bullet,I,X,\\Sigma)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure9\\text{-}transition\\text{-}semigroup} \\vdash \\mathrm{MeasureTransitionSemigroup}_S(P_\\bullet,I,X,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcProb2TransitionSemigroup}_S(P_\\bullet,I,X,\\Sigma)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The reused predicate types every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_t\">\\(P_t\\)</span> as a Markov kernel and expresses Chapman–Kolmogorov by kernel integration, including the identity kernel at time <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-prob2-transition-semigroup.md","status":"resolved","id":"e8b953a1717b11c0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-prob2-transition-semigroup.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-prob2-transition-semigroup.md","status":"resolved","id":"e8b953a1717b11c0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcProb2TransitionSemigroup}_S$ (canonical predicate, see [[../batch01/58-df-zfc-prob2-transition-semigroup.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X,\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"P_\\bullet","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2TransitionSemigroup}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasureTransitionSemigroup}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure9\\text{-}transition\\text{-}semigroup} \\vdash \\mathrm{MeasureTransitionSemigroup}_S(P_\\bullet,I,X,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcProb2TransitionSemigroup}_S(P_\\bullet,I,X,\\Sigma)","display":true},{"tex":"P_t","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false}],"bytes":1151,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2679","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-measure9-transition-semigroup.md|58-df-zfc-measure9-transition-semigroup]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["e8b953a1717b11c0"]}